Popumeter was added in '''Beta 39.0''' as one of the various cards using the new Thorns effect. It was a 3/6 for 5G monster that gained +1 Thorn for each other monster on the board when played (so both ally and enemy, up to 7).

It didn't receive any changes until '''Beta 49.0''', when Thorns was already removed, leading in a redesign. While its cost stayed at 5G, it's now a 4/4 (thus +1/-2). It has has Disarmed, Armor (1) and a Support effect that makes it attack a random enemy monster on either edge of the board. This Support effect was changed in '''Beta 51.1''', now making it attack the rightmost enemy monster.

